{"title":"2005 PMWC Problems/Problem I12","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>In the figure below, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/a/65af420a6e2b903f5295dd8f65f321545f69e44d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BCDE$\" width=\"58\" height=\"12\" /> is a parallelogram, points <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/5/a055f405829e64a3b70253ab67cb45ed6ed5bb29.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$F$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/2/6e28ce12d49d39f160d5a0ef54077fc98e4b9d2b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$G$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> are on the\nsegment <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/2/bc2afec04e3636c80fa3d89e5468045595151c4d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ED$\" width=\"29\" height=\"12\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/a/eea6d74b22c9c0c032d83f29d6483eaf1a635183.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BCA$\" width=\"42\" height=\"13\" /> is a right angled triangle, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/1/7/a179ff2638e4799cadd820db205c2beff6299ce9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" /> is perpendicular to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/5/6c52a41dcbd739f1d026c5d4f181438b75b76976.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" />.Suppose that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/5/0/550198a7c6261e84a04e1c27b811b817677218d9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BC=8cm$\" width=\"85\" height=\"12\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/5/e/45e0e04afcf18cef1d92017fc148934e1c3a56ea.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AC=7cm$\" width=\"84\" height=\"13\" />, and the area of the shaded regions is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/3/3/e3381b9297c0ad4df31c7f6cdbfd6c96bfb86c8f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12cm^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"48\" height=\"15\" /> more than that of the triangle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/6/0/8600e69a900b0105eb63e8712ffca58544004c00.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AFG$\" width=\"42\" height=\"13\" />. What is the length of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/a/8/ca8854f11c419c65f97c8b11a63e717784cf79f9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$CG$\" width=\"28\" height=\"12\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/3/5/13537a2d06c8399fb689c4dcdbcc75d4c522a59d.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] fill((0,0)--(1,1)--(3,1)--(2,0)--cycle,grey); fill((0,0)--(2,1.5)--(2,0)--cycle,white); draw((0,0)--(2,1.5)--(2,0)--cycle,dot); draw((0,0)--(1,1)--(3,1)--(2,0)--cycle,dot); MP(&quot;B&quot;,(0,0),W);MP(&quot;A&quot;,(2,1.5),N);MP(&quot;C&quot;,(2,0),S); MP(&quot;E&quot;,(1,1),NW);MP(&quot;D&quot;,(3,1),NE); MP(&quot;F&quot;,(1.5,1),NW);MP(&quot;G&quot;,(2,1),NE); draw((1.9,0)--(1.9,.1)--(2,.1),linewidth(.75)); [/asy]\" width=\"252\" height=\"145\" />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span>